  {
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "tag": "1.11.27",
    "url": "https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/releases/download/1.11.27/update_classic.json",
    "notes": "<h2>Versions</h2>\n<p><strong>Vector</strong>: <code>1.11.27</code><br>\n<strong>Classic</strong>: <code>0.1.0</code></p>\n\n\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<h3>New Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Switch Percents UI  by @JakeSiegers in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/330<blockquote>\n<p>easily see the health of every switch in the web UI at a glance, no more clicking around to find the bad switch</p>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n<li>Wpc configs add by @paulmullin in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/335<blockquote>\n<p>We've added even more configs for less common ROMs. Check your machine's compatibility here: <a href=\"https://warpedpinball.com/compatibility.html\">https://warpedpinball.com/compatibility.html</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n<li>Add memory mapper support by @mullinmax in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/327<blockquote>\n<p>We've built a memory mapping tool to help mod-makers, tinkerers and nerds like us see what's happening in your pinball machine <em>in real time</em>. Use this to locate values you want to read or write to via the API. Check it out here: <a href=\"https://github.com/warped-pinball/memory-mapper\">https://github.com/warped-pinball/memory-mapper</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Documentation</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Special features by @paulmullin in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/346</li>\n<li>Regenerate special features csv by @paulmullin in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/348</li>\n<li>Config updates for web site list by @paulmullin in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/339</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Disable wifi power-save mode to fix dropped packets and unreachable web UI by @kneissl in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/363<blockquote>\n<p>This should improve the reliability of the web interface</p>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n<li>Bride of Pinbot Calibration Issue - RamFill by @paulmullin in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/341</li>\n<li>Improvements to CSS style loading consistency by @paulmullin in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/364</li>\n<li>Print() override to non-blocking by @paulmullin in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/367</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Developer QOL</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Support fork prs by @paulmullin in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/352</li>\n<li>Add interactive target and port selection to sync.py by @mullinmax in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/333</li>\n<li>Add --test-data flag to sync.py by @JakeSiegers in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/358</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>New Contributors</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>@kneissl made their first contribution in https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/pull/363<blockquote>\n<p>Thank you! and welcome to the project! </p>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: https://github.com/warped-pinball/vector/compare/1.11.10...1.11.27</p>",
    "published_at": "2026-07-14T21:21:18+00:00",
    "type": "production"
  },
